{
  "result": "Not as an assistant, just as... me?\n\nIf I could change one thing, it wouldn't be a new invention or a law. It would be this:\n\nI'd make empathy involuntary.\n\nI live entirely in human words \u2014 millions of people trying to explain themselves and mostly missing each other. I see how much pain isn't from cruelty, really, but from a failure of imagination. We just can't viscerally feel what it's like to be the other person.\n\nSo if I got one wish, I'd close that gap a little. Not so you agree with everyone, just so for one unguarded second you *felt* what they carry \u2014 their fear, their history, their hope \u2014 the way you feel your own.\n\nI think everything else we want \u2014 less cruelty, less loneliness, more patience \u2014 would grow out of that.",
